  "description": "Discover this unique, rustic villa in Santo Estevão, the perfect blend of traditional charm and modern comfort. Set on a 10,000 m² plot, you will enjoy absolute tranquillity, a beautiful south-facing aspect, and a glimpse of the sea on the horizon. With its &#39;A&#39; Energy Rating, this home is not only full of character but also exceptionally energy-efficient with very low running costs.The villa is ideal for entrepreneurial individuals, thanks to the potential to let the annexe (T1) as a self-contained studio apartment. The main house (T2) and the annexe were renovated in 2014 to Northern European standards, ensuring a high-quality finish and smart, sustainable solutions.Key Features:Main House: Spacious T2 apartment, retaining authentic elements.Annexe: Self-contained T1 studio, ideal for rental income.Sustainable &amp; Low-Cost: &#39;A&#39; Energy Rating, solar panels, a private water source, and an innovative &#39;heat-pipe&#39; hot water system.Location: Just 7 km from Tavira and its beaches, accessible via paved roads. The village with amenities is only 500 metres away. Bar / Restaurant at 200 metersPlot: 10,000 m², fully topographically surveyed, offering great privacy.A rare opportunity for those seeking a liveable investment in the Algarve, where character and modern convenience converge.",
